{
  "schema_version": "task-contract/v1",
  "contract_id": "2026.09.29-№1-vaulter-stable-p1-1",
  "version": {
    "revision": 1,
    "content_hash": "81c48eaf958a28deebd04b0663b01740c75985ed3997ff63b1c009746e589372",
    "supersedes": null
  },
  "goal": {
    "outcome": "Все транзакции, блокировки и after-commit колбэки Vaulter идут через одно соединение\n`Vaulter\\Database\\VaulterDatabase`, совпадающее с соединением моделей и схемы, так что настроенный\n`vaulter.connection ≠ default` не лишает операции атомарности (N01, D25).",
    "non_goals": [
      "канонический ключ `vaulter.database.connection` и нормализатор (P2.5)",
      "`config()` вне `Configuration\\`\n(P2.5)",
      "порядок блокировок D21 и условная квота (P1.6)",
      "перенос ключа CAS-lock на `scope_key` (P1.5)",
      "запись outbox в\nтранзакции Action (P5.1)."
    ]
  },
  "must": [
    {
      "id": "M1",
      "requirement": "1. `packages/core/src/Database/VaulterDatabase.php` — `final class VaulterDatabase` (singleton в\n   `VaulterServiceProvider::register()`), конструктор `(Illuminate\\Database\\DatabaseManager $db)`:\n   - `connection(): Illuminate\\Database\\Connection` → `$this->db->connection(Config::connection())` (R1: ключ\n     `vaulter.connection`, null = соединение по умолчанию)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M2",
      "requirement": "- `driver(): string` → `$this->connection()->getDriverName()` (`pgsql|mysql|mariadb|sqlite`)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M3",
      "requirement": "- `transaction(Closure $callback, int $attempts = 3): mixed` → `$this->connection()->transaction($callback, $attempts)` (R4)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4",
      "requirement": "- `lockTree(int|string $storageId): void` — требует открытую транзакцию на этом соединении (`transactionLevel() > 0`,\n     иначе `LogicException('[Vaulter] lockTree() must run inside VaulterDatabase::transaction().')`)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M5",
      "requirement": "PG:\n     `SELECT pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtext(?))` с ключом `'vaulter:tree:'.$storageId`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M6",
      "requirement": "mysql/mariadb/sqlite:\n     `SELECT id FROM <Config::table('storages')> WHERE id = ? FOR UPDATE` (SQLite — тот же запрос без `FOR UPDATE`,\n     писатель и так единственный). Имя параметра — `$storageId` (текущее имя",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M7",
      "requirement": "канон `driveId` — P2.1)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M8",
      "requirement": "- `advisoryLock(string $key): void` — то же требование транзакции",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M9",
      "requirement": "PG: `SELECT pg_advisory_xact_lock(hashtext(?))`\n     с `$key`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M10",
      "requirement": "иначе no-op (MySQL — `FOR UPDATE` строки в вызывающем, SQLite — единственный писатель",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M11",
      "requirement": "поведение\n     `BlobLock` сохраняется)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M12",
      "requirement": "- `afterCommit(Closure $callback): void` → `$this->connection()->afterCommit($callback)`.\n2. `core/src/Cas/BlobLock.php`: зависимость `VaulterDatabase`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M13",
      "requirement": "`acquire()` → `advisoryLock($scope.'|'.$sha256)`\n   (формат ключа не меняется до P1.5)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M14",
      "requirement": "`driver()` → `VaulterDatabase::driver()`.\n3. Замена фасада `DB` во всех файлах `src` кроме `core/src/Database/` и `core/src/Schema/`: `DB::transaction(` →\n   `$this->database->transaction(`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M15",
      "requirement": "`DB::connection()`/`DB::table()`/`DB::statement()`/`DB::select()`/`DB::raw()` →\n   `$this->database->connection()->…`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M16",
      "requirement": "`DB::afterCommit(` → `$this->database->afterCommit(`. `VaulterDatabase` внедряется\n   конструктором (readonly-классы — новым promoted-параметром `private VaulterDatabase $database`). Ожидаемый инвентарь —\n   команда Code Guidance п.1 печатает ровно эти 44 файла (без `PanelTablesBuilder.php`, он в `Schema\\`):\n   core — `Webhooks/{SigningSecretEncryptor,RecordsOutbox,WebhookRetryDispatcher,OutboxRelay}.php`,\n   `Cas/BlobLock.php`, `Activity/RecordsActivity.php`, `Actions/Webhooks/{Update,Register,Delete,Deactivate}WebhookEndpointAction.php`,\n   `Actions/Sharing/{Revoke,Create}ShareLinkAction.php`, `Actions/Access/{Revoke,Grant}NodeAccessAction.php`,\n   `Repositories/Drive/NodeStoreRepository.php`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M17",
      "requirement": "drive — `Repositories/Uploads/{UploadPartStoreRepository,UploadSessionStoreRepository}.php`,\n   `Uploads/{UploadSessionManager,TusUploadHandler,S3MultipartHandler}.php`, `StorageManager.php`, `Console/PurgeTrashCommand.php`,\n   `Actions/Uploads/CommitUploadAction.php`, `Actions/{UploadFileAction,TrashNodeAction,RestoreNodeAction,RenameNodeAction,MoveNodeAction,ForceDeleteNodeAction,CreateFolderAction,CopyNodeAction}.php`,\n   `Models/Uploads/UploadPart.php`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M18",
      "requirement": "documents —\n   `Actions/Versions/{RestoreDocumentVersionAction,CreateNamedVersionAction}.php`, `Actions/Documents/{UpdateDocumentContentAction,CreateDocumentNodeAction}.php`,\n   `Actions/Comments/{ResolveNodeCommentAction,DeleteNodeCommentAction,AddNodeCommentAction}.php`, `Actions/Collaboration/PersistYjsSnapshotAction.php`,\n   `Repositories/Versions/NodeDocumentVersionStoreRepository.php`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M19",
      "requirement": "media — `Cas/{BlobGarbageCollector,BlobStore,BlobReconciler}.php`.\n   В моделях (`UploadPart.php`) без конструкторного DI — `app(VaulterDatabase::class)`.\n4. Arch-тест в `packages/core/tests/Arch/ArchTest.php` и в `packages/{drive,documents,media,filament}/tests/Arch/ArchTest.php`:\n   `arch('DB facade only in Database and Schema (AD25)')->expect('Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\DB')->toOnlyBeUsedIn(['Vaulter\\Database', 'Vaulter\\Schema'])`\n   — в core",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M20",
      "requirement": "в остальных пакетах — `->expect('<Пакетный namespace>')->not->toUse('Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\DB')`\n   (`Vaulter\\Drive`, `Vaulter\\Documents`, `Vaulter\\Media`, `Vaulter\\Filament`).\n5. Тесты: `packages/core/tests/Database/VaulterDatabaseTest.php` (любая БД: `connection()` = соединение моделей при\n   `vaulter.connection='vaulter'`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M21",
      "requirement": "`lockTree`/`advisoryLock` вне транзакции → `LogicException`",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M22",
      "requirement": "`transaction()` повторяет\n   замыкание при `QueryException` с кодом `40001` ровно до 3 попыток — подменённым замыканием-счётчиком на SQLite)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M23",
      "requirement": "`packages/drive/tests/Concurrency/DedicatedConnectionTest.php` — V17 на PG.\n6. Документация: `docs/guide/database-compatibility.md` раздел «Dedicated database connection» — транзакции, блокировки и\n   after-commit идут на этом соединении",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M24",
      "requirement": "`CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased]` (Fixed: N01, AD25)",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    },
    {
      "id": "M25",
      "requirement": "`PublicApiSnapshotTest` golden\n   (новый класс `Vaulter\\Database\\VaulterDatabase`).",
      "source_ref": "phases/P1.md:12"
    }
  ],
